+  /* Ember(d12games4): 예약 버퍼 → 자리잡이 희소 버퍼(메모리 없음, UpdateTileMappings 가 힙 타일을 건다) */
+  HRESULT
+  InitializeReserved(const D3D12_RESOURCE_DESC *pDesc) {
+    desc_ = *pDesc;
+    heap_props_ = {D3D12_HEAP_TYPE_DEFAULT, D3D12_CPU_PAGE_PROPERTY_UNKNOWN, D3D12_MEMORY_POOL_UNKNOWN, 1, 1};
+    heap_flags_ = D3D12_HEAP_FLAG_NONE;
+    if (desc_.Alignment && desc_.Alignment != D3D12_DEFAULT_RESOURCE_PLACEMENT_ALIGNMENT)
+      return E_INVALIDARG;
+    desc_.Alignment = D3D12_DEFAULT_RESOURCE_PLACEMENT_ALIGNMENT;
+    uint64_t len = (std::max<uint64_t>(desc_.Width, 1) + 65535) & ~65535ull;
+    struct unixcall_ember_sparse p;
+    memset(&p, 0, sizeof(p));
+    p.op = EMBER_SPARSE_OP_NEW_BUFFER;
+    p.device = device_->GetMTLDevice().handle;
+    p.length = len;
+    p.options = WMTResourceHazardTrackingModeUntracked | WMTResourceStorageModePrivate;
+    p.page = WMTSparsePageSize64;
+    if (device_->EmberSparseCall(p) != 1 || !p.out_handle)
+      return E_NOTIMPL;
+    buffer = new Buffer(desc_.Width, device_->GetMTLDevice());
+    WMTBufferInfo info;
+    info.memory.set(nullptr);
+    info.length = len;
+    info.options = (WMTResourceOptions)p.options;
+    info.gpu_address = p.out_gpu_address;
+    Flags<BufferAllocationFlag> flags;
+    flags.set(BufferAllocationFlag::CpuInvisible);
+    buffer->rename(buffer->adopt(flags, WMT::Reference<WMT::Buffer>(p.out_handle), info));
+    device_->RegisterResidencyAndVA(buffer->current());
+    if (EmberD12TraceEnabled)
+      EmberD12Trace(TraceKind::ResourceMap, 0, 0, 0, 0, (uintptr_t)this, (uintptr_t)buffer->current(), (uintptr_t)buffer.ptr(), buffer->current()->gpuAddress(), desc_.Width, 1);
+    ember_sparse.on = true;
+    ember_sparse.is_buffer = true;
+    ember_sparse.width = (uint32_t)std::min<uint64_t>(len, 0xffffffffull);
+    ember_sparse.metal = p.out_handle;
+    ember_sparse.finish();
+    return S_OK;
+  }
